  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The proposed raising of the ridge height, by reason of its siting, height, design and appearance, would result in an incongruous and unsympathetic form of development that disrupts the current ridgeline, to the detriment of the appearance and character of of the host dwelling, the streetscene and surrounding area. The proposed development is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), and Policies D12.1, D12.3 and D12.4 of the Merton Local Plan (2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
